    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "the effort doesn't matter though. the math doesn't care about \"meaning.\" if the pattern of my life is just a series of systems breaking down, then the breakdown is the only constant. it’s not just a bad streak, it’s the actual trajectory. i look at the data of my life and all i see is a downward slope towards zero. if you follow the logic of where i am headed, there isn't really a way to reverse the momentum. it just feels like i'm fighting a losing battle against physics at this point.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
